{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_03",
  "title": "音樂室內的光芒",
  "storyCode": "SS-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c83addfcc923268cdc774b14307df859c2e2e67cbfa8eb77c02e55d2bb7f1db3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一開始，我只當作是接到了一份再普通不過的工作。\n一個沒沒無名的小家族需要我的力量，以便在風雨飄搖的敘拉古站穩腳跟。\n然而隨著日子一天天過去，他們越來越信任我，甚至帶我參加家族的核心會議。\n我明知這與合約內容不符，卻又很享受待在這些人中的感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g10_smallrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喲！海鈴小妹妹，好幾天不見了，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏，橘子口味的奶凍。我沒記錯的話，你喜歡這個口味吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用，我自己有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*哥倫比亞粗口*，不要這麼不領情啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是聽說你單槍匹馬把之前騷擾我們的那群傢伙趕走了，想感謝你一下啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離我遠一點。我只是個拿錢辦事的打手，做完這票就會離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果等一下你們老大看到我們兩個混在一起，你肯定沒有好下場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係啦，老大上次跟我說了，他早就想邀請你加入我們了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我建議你們還是再多打聽一下我在敘拉古的名聲吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用打聽啦，你已經是我們見過的最強的人了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我說，你不如現在就答應吧。今晚的家族聚餐，我們一起去啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與其說是家族聚餐，不如說是樂隊表演吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，我們家族的勢力雖然比較小，但成員之間的情誼是別人比不了的啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且你不是和我們一起表演了很多次嗎？大家都很有默契了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……等我哪天有空再說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你之前也是這樣說的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g11_mansionhall"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我拒絕了他的盛情邀約。\n但回家的路上，我的心中卻湧起一種莫名的感覺。\n一種從未有過的感覺。\n那晚我躺在床上輾轉反側，整夜未眠。\n太陽還未升起之時，我就收拾好了所有的行李——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……誰會找到這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_699_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海鈴，老爺那邊出了點狀況，想讓你幫忙頂罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我已經決定……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_699_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "監獄那邊我們已經安排好了，他們正在下面等著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_699_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些是報酬，如果你覺得不夠，還可以再加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_699_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海鈴，你今天怎麼回事？是我說錯什麼了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_699_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前不是一直都是這樣嗎——我們出錢，你辦事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_699_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快去吧，我們會想辦法幫你減到半年，半年就能出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cellroomC"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "作為被僱傭的打手，幫人頂罪是再正常不過的事，我對監獄的生活也再熟悉不過。\n但這次，唯獨這次，我卻無比地煎熬。\n半年裡，我無時無刻不想著出獄，想回到那個家族中，回到他們的樂隊派對裡。\n我已經決定好了自己的歸宿。\n但我沒想到，最後的結局卻是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g2_srcalley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老大死了，大家都死了，幾百個人現在只剩我們十幾個了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們一群兄弟好不容易從哥倫比亞漂泊到這個鬼地方，結果全被你害死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g2_srcalley"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這半年到底發生了什麼事情？\n我不知道，但我唯一知道的是——\n我又一次失去了“家”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g7_reception"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海鈴，你幫我做了這麼多件事，賣了這麼多次命，我應當給你一個身分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我允許你加入我的家族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你知道我從來都是獨來獨往，不會加入任何一個家族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不願，還是不能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海鈴，我和那些自稱“家族領袖”的地痞流氓不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在這個地方和那些陰險狡詐的大家族鬥了大半輩子，從來沒有離開過牌桌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你希望我幫你登上更大的牌桌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很聰明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但和做交易不一樣，加入一個家族需要考慮的事情更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做交易只需考慮雇主的開價，加入一個家族則要考慮領袖的人品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，我知道我的風評不算好，但這不就是我們相似的地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海鈴，除了我，還有人願意接納你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敘拉古太危險，家族和秩序之下，全是陰謀和算計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你上一次安穩地睡覺是什麼時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "側躺在紙箱上，手中還要時時刻刻拿著匕首戒備……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“獨狼終有歸宿”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是回歸狼群，恢復身分和名譽……還是橫屍荒野，被野獸分食。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_699_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺，她引來了一些不乾淨的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子的雙手被反銬著，動彈不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_699_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一個傢伙跑了，我們正在派人追捕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海鈴，你認識這位小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不認識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不記得我們的那些舊帳了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看樣子是來尋仇的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海鈴，我給你時間和場地，你自己處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過了，我不認識她……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是你加入我的家族前的最後一項考驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次……就不要拿提前準備的血袋偽裝現場了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小巷裡，唯有祥子和海鈴兩個人。\n但她們知道，有人正在期待這場決鬥如何收場。\n海鈴知道，老爺正在看。\n祥子知道，莫菲絲也在看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我跟你無冤無仇，你何必尋死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是來接你回去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接我回去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是回撞球間，而是回到你本來應該在的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽不懂你在說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算你聽不懂，我也必須拉住你，不能讓你就這樣去死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暗算弗朗西斯他們的人，就是老爺的手下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不相信一個背地裡陷害你的人，會給你想要的歸宿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是……可是……"
    },
